+<!doctype html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#f5f6f2">
+<title>Daymark — Personal board</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
+</head>
+<body>
+<header class="topbar"><a class="brand" href="#" aria-label="Daymark home"><span class="brand-mark">d</span> daymark</a><div class="top-actions"><label class="search"><span>⌕</span><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Find a task…" aria-label="Search tasks"><kbd>/</kbd></label><button class="icon-button" id="export" title="Export backup" aria-label="Export backup">⇩</button><button class="avatar" id="clearSearch" title="Clear search">JD</button></div></header>
+<main><section class="intro"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> YOUR PERSONAL SPACE</p><h1>Make room for<br><em>what matters.</em></h1><p class="subhead">A little clarity goes a long way.</p></div><div class="date-card"><span id="todayLabel"></span><strong id="todayDate"></strong><span id="taskSummary"></span></div></section>
+<section class="toolbar"><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter tasks"><button class="filter active" data-filter="all">Everything</button><button class="filter" data-filter="today">Due today</button><button class="filter" data-filter="overdue">Overdue</button></div><button class="primary" id="addTask"><span>＋</span> New task</button></section>
+<section class="board" id="board" aria-label="Kanban board"></section>
+<footer><span>Small steps, steady progress.</span><span id="saveStatus">Saved on this device</span></footer></main>
+<dialog id="taskDialog"><form id="taskForm"><div class="modal-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">MAKE IT HAPPEN</p><h2 id="dialogTitle">New task</h2></div><button type="button" class="close" id="closeDialog" aria-label="Close">×</button></div><input type="hidden" id="taskId"><label class="field">Task name<input id="taskName" required maxlength="120" placeholder="What needs doing?"></label><label class="field">A little more detail <span class="optional">· optional</span><textarea id="taskNotes" rows="3" maxlength="500" placeholder="Add a note…"></textarea></label><div class="field-row"><label class="field">Priority<select id="taskPriority"><option value="low">Low</option><option value="medium" selected>Medium</option><option value="high">High</option></select></label><label class="field">Due date<input id="taskDue" type="date"></label></div><label class="field">Column<select id="taskColumn"></select></label><label class="field">Tags <span class="optional">· comma separated</span><input id="taskTags" maxlength="100" placeholder="work, personal"></label><div class="modal-actions"><button type="button" class="delete-button" id="deleteTask">Delete task</button><button type="button" class="secondary" id="cancelDialog">Cancel</button><button class="primary" type="submit">Save task</button></div></form></dialog>
+<input type="file" id="importFile" accept="application/json" hidden>
+<script src="app.js"></script>
+</body></html>
